<title>GERMANY: German Feb M3 rises annualised 9.1 pct.</title>
<headline>German Feb M3 rises annualised 9.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank gave the following data for German M3 money supply growth in February</p>
<p>						   Feb 97	   Jan 97</p>
<p>Annualised vs average Q4 1996	    9.1	     11.7 pct</p>
<p>Annualised vs average Q4 1995	    8.3		8.6 pct</p>
<p>Non-annualised vs average Q4 1996	2.2		1.9 pct</p>
<p>Note - The Bundesbank's target range for 1997 M3 money supply growth is 3-1/2 to 6-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
